    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919850/extras/6ca794d6c97ef6c6f27300bcec8d9252.avif?t=1742128927\" width=800 height=178 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIND EDEN<br>...is a story-rich experience full of cats!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong>Timmy</strong>, a young boy whose fears and dreams come to life in a surreal, monochromatic world. When a mysterious creature lures him into the night, Timmy finds himself in a strange, eerie realm overrun by monsters and inhabited by enigmatic cats. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a haunting landscape, solve intricate puzzles, and uncover the secrets of this shadowy world as you piece together Timmy's past and his connection to this dark place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Indirectly you will find clues about the world of 'Find Eden', its characters and the mystery that veiled this fantastic world.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MEET CATS IN THEIR OWN REALM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919850/extras/8fe62c4326726286e5e81866e855a9b9.poster.avif?t=1742128927\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919850/extras/8fe62c4326726286e5e81866e855a9b9.webm?t=1742128927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919850/extras/8fe62c4326726286e5e81866e855a9b9.mp4?t=1742128927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FRIEND OR FOE?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919850/extras/fcddb820fc4958593ee108e80fcc101e.poster.avif?t=1742128927\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919850/extras/fcddb820fc4958593ee108e80fcc101e.webm?t=1742128927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919850/extras/fcddb820fc4958593ee108e80fcc101e.mp4?t=1742128927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NEW GAME MECHANIC</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timmy receives an unknown talisman that holds inexplicable powers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It gives Timmy the courage he was lacking!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When entering a new world, with this talisman you can plan ahead and manipulate your surroundings by setting up traps, making platforms move, placing portals, throwing spells to see creatures hiding in the dark and more!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HAND-DRAWN UNIQUE ASSETS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel mysterious unexplored lands, each with their own landmarks and creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Find Eden</i></strong><i> </i> focuses on detailed natural worlds to immerse you in the story. You explore, solve puzzles, fight monsters and upgrade your new awakened powers. Reshape these worlds and help out the cats! You meet some kitties who want to know you, but some just want to bug you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAIN GAME FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Classic side-scrolling action, with all the modern trimmings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Various powers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Plan ahead and build your fighting route</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cute main story that leaves you wanting more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Befriend cats!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Battle with creepy monsters </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Find clues and solve riddles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Make your way through all the traps</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919850/extras/4950211e0c9aba49dd05c582bc0b6ab9.avif?t=1742128927\" width=800 height=178 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919850/extras/6ca794d6c97ef6c6f27300bcec8d9252.avif?t=1742128927\" width=800 height=178 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIND EDEN<br>...is a story-rich experience full of cats!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong>Timmy</strong>, a young boy whose fears and dreams come to life in a surreal, monochromatic world. When a mysterious creature lures him into the night, Timmy finds himself in a strange, eerie realm overrun by monsters and inhabited by enigmatic cats. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a haunting landscape, solve intricate puzzles, and uncover the secrets of this shadowy world as you piece together Timmy's past and his connection to this dark place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Indirectly you will find clues about the world of 'Find Eden', its characters and the mystery that veiled this fantastic world.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MEET CATS IN THEIR OWN REALM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919850/extras/8fe62c4326726286e5e81866e855a9b9.poster.avif?t=1742128927\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919850/extras/8fe62c4326726286e5e81866e855a9b9.webm?t=1742128927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919850/extras/8fe62c4326726286e5e81866e855a9b9.mp4?t=1742128927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FRIEND OR FOE?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919850/extras/fcddb820fc4958593ee108e80fcc101e.poster.avif?t=1742128927\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919850/extras/fcddb820fc4958593ee108e80fcc101e.webm?t=1742128927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919850/extras/fcddb820fc4958593ee108e80fcc101e.mp4?t=1742128927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NEW GAME MECHANIC</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timmy receives an unknown talisman that holds inexplicable powers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It gives Timmy the courage he was lacking!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When entering a new world, with this talisman you can plan ahead and manipulate your surroundings by setting up traps, making platforms move, placing portals, throwing spells to see creatures hiding in the dark and more!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HAND-DRAWN UNIQUE ASSETS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel mysterious unexplored lands, each with their own landmarks and creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Find Eden</i></strong><i> </i> focuses on detailed natural worlds to immerse you in the story. You explore, solve puzzles, fight monsters and upgrade your new awakened powers. Reshape these worlds and help out the cats! You meet some kitties who want to know you, but some just want to bug you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAIN GAME FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Classic side-scrolling action, with all the modern trimmings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Various powers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Plan ahead and build your fighting route</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cute main story that leaves you wanting more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Befriend cats!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Battle with creepy monsters </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Find clues and solve riddles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Make your way through all the traps</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919850/extras/4950211e0c9aba49dd05c582bc0b6ab9.avif?t=1742128927\" width=800 height=178 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Play as Timmy, whisked into a mysterious cat realm invaded by monsters. Journey through enchanting realms, solve puzzles, and harness new abilities to save this world\u2014and maybe your own\u2014in a cozy, dark, and hand-drawn 2D adventure full of secrets and quirky cats.",
